## Strategic HUD UI

- Button + panel peer to Company on **`WBP_SimHud`**.
- Default view: player character (name / Id / company / avatar placeholders).
- Corner **所有角色列表** → sub-list of **all** registry characters (**no filter** this slice). Dedicated filters / intel range: **later**.
- Open: **no** SimTime pause; **no** sail block.
- Esc: close 编制 → 角色 → 商号 → 系统菜单.
- Optional: `BP_SimPlayerController` → **UI|Character** → Character Panel Class.
- Info line **职位：** from `GetCharacterOfficeTitle` (no post write on Character).

City tavern UI: see **`facility-system.mdc`**. Sub-panel under city panel (peer to market). Empty list stays empty (no generate button).

## Explicitly out (this slice)

- Age / BirthDate / death
- Kin / birth / retainer
- Character-list filters / intel range
- Generate-on-open tavern
- Hire cost / Character-panel dismiss UI
- Storing posts on `UCharacterObject` / `FCharacterSaveData`
- NPC fleet **crews** (command AI is host-budget on the fleet — see `npc-ai.mdc`; other posts still numeric only)
- Individual character 3D mesh / skeletal animation / strategic-map person Actor — see **`character-visual-policy.mdc`**
- Ship-level 舰长 controlling fleet actions (fleet orders = 司令 only)
- Player/NPC UObject subclasses (single `UCharacterObject`)
- Name+surname random tables
- Old-save migrate (pre-v5 discarded)
